{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, I need to talk to you. My friends were mocking my weight last Friday and it hurt. That made me realize I need to make changes."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-5d1d8a49bae7168f16a3838d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.833472+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5d1d8a49bae7168f16a3838d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5d1d8a49bae7168f16a3838d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, sorry about that. Don't worry, progress takes time. Let's work on it together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-4cff4bf1ed6b15dbc882bd81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.858627+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4cff4bf1ed6b15dbc882bd81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4cff4bf1ed6b15dbc882bd81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks for the support, Evan. I'm working on my health and getting active!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-d215bc6e1a791197a3bd551d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.875750+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d215bc6e1a791197a3bd551d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d215bc6e1a791197a3bd551d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: That's great, Sam! I struggled with my health a few years ago, but stuck with it. Here's a reminder of my commitment - my gym membership card. It's not just about exercise, diet and lifestyle changes also play a big role."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-fd71e0538399d56523beb0d2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.887952+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fd71e0538399d56523beb0d2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fd71e0538399d56523beb0d2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That's awesome, Evan! What do you think made the biggest impact on your health journey?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-8a7fcf9d3a5b51f77ece9084", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.903054+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8a7fcf9d3a5b51f77ece9084", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8a7fcf9d3a5b51f77ece9084", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I made some dietary changes, like cutting down on sugary snacks and eating more veggies and fruit, and it made a big impact on my health. Have you considered any changes?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-4c0f17acaa867e16d66b1138", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.916434+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c0f17acaa867e16d66b1138", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c0f17acaa867e16d66b1138", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Yep, I'm reducing my soda and candy intake. It's tough, but I'm determined to make a change."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-6c20d303e5945bf3b6d0f5e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.933038+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6c20d303e5945bf3b6d0f5e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6c20d303e5945bf3b6d0f5e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Go for it, Sam! It's tough at first, but you got this. Try flavored seltzer water instead. It can be a great alternative to soda. Btw I can't stop thinking about that new mystery novel I started. It's so gripping!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-a1300ca1a716cf6d81d0c624", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.948171+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a1300ca1a716cf6d81d0c624", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a1300ca1a716cf6d81d0c624", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Sounds good, Evan. I've tried it before and it was nice. Do you have any ideas for low-calorie snacks to pair with it? And what's the novel?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-00ab9c57d62b418c6ae704cb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.965941+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "00ab9c57d62b418c6ae704cb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "00ab9c57d62b418c6ae704cb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Definitely, how about some flavored seltzer with some air-popped popcorn or fruit? It's yum and healthy! The novel I'm reading is \"The Great Gatsby\"."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-2c5096cb6597b22b9a24806e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.983182+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c5096cb6597b22b9a24806e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c5096cb6597b22b9a24806e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Yum, that sounds good! Thanks! And I'll definitely read that novel sometime."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-7eab5da016f0aaf8ed835be2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:11.999746+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7eab5da016f0aaf8ed835be2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7eab5da016f0aaf8ed835be2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: No worries, Sam! Focus on healthy swaps and taking small steps. Stay upbeat!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-cf42d4c10c4bae980e135fb9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.014771+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cf42d4c10c4bae980e135fb9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cf42d4c10c4bae980e135fb9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That reminder is inspiring. Thanks for reminding me to focus on progress, not perfection."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-e7035fb5ffaafb534e063304", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.028032+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e7035fb5ffaafb534e063304", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e7035fb5ffaafb534e063304", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: By the way, have you thought about exercising? Trust me, it's just as important as eating right."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-fec5fc058673943789dee4ca", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.041795+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fec5fc058673943789dee4ca", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fec5fc058673943789dee4ca", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Starting tomorrow, I will go to the gym and exercise regularly. The sooner I start, the sooner I will see the rewards of this activity."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-4f2ecc891fd2e1b0f269b525", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.057325+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4f2ecc891fd2e1b0f269b525", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4f2ecc891fd2e1b0f269b525", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: That's awesome, Sam! It's such a rewarding and tough activity - keep going and have fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-47db4e9756505881a16c8fa4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.074832+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "47db4e9756505881a16c8fa4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "47db4e9756505881a16c8fa4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! Your support means a lot. I really appreciate it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-b256598ffb682ec1b75bbcd8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.086889+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b256598ffb682ec1b75bbcd8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b256598ffb682ec1b75bbcd8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: No worries, you've got this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-d0135c0d0086a7aae7957dc6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.100638+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d0135c0d0086a7aae7957dc6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d0135c0d0086a7aae7957dc6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan. I really appreciate it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-e64b42b6cc7eb25d84e6a7bc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.115500+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e64b42b6cc7eb25d84e6a7bc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e64b42b6cc7eb25d84e6a7bc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: No worries, Sam. I'm here if you need me. Keep going!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_4-f359dd8c0d21873c992b3b6e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:04:12.130587+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f359dd8c0d21873c992b3b6e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f359dd8c0d21873c992b3b6e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
